    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub remains anchored to the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), which defines the system by its capacity to capture decision artifacts at the point of consensus. Since March 2026, the discourse has shifted from this abstract foundational framing toward the concrete realization of technical milestones. As of July 2026, the team has transitioned to reporting on specific delivery mechanisms, notably the [successful shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_1). This shipment is framed alongside the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_3) as the primary technical unlock. The [team's internal framing](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryAndUnlock) continues to interrogate the alignment between these specific technical outputs and the broader, original mandate of consensus capture, maintaining a focus on communal sharing and technical competence.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_1> ;
